{
  "name": "Personal Voice Agent - Tasks and Day Planner",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## START HERE\n\nPersonal voice agent backend.\n\nYou call a Vapi phone number. Vapi talks to Gemini and calls these 3 webhooks as tools.\n\n**What you must set up (all free tiers):**\n1. Vapi account (vapi.ai) - free number + 60 min/month\n2. Google AI Studio key (aistudio.google.com) - free Gemini\n3. Google Sheet named 'Voice Agent Tasks', tab 'Tasks', headers: id, task, priority, due, status\n4. n8n credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2\n\nThen activate this workflow and paste the 3 production webhook URLs into Vapi tools.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "n-start",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Start Here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -96,
        176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## API KEY 1: GEMINI\n\nGo to aistudio.google.com > Get API key (free).\n\nIn n8n: Credentials > New > Header Auth\nName: x-goog-api-key\nValue: YOUR_KEY\n\nAlso paste the same key in Vapi > Provider Keys > Google.\n\nModel used for planning: gemini-2.5-flash.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "n-gemini",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Gemini Key",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        224,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## API KEY 2: VAPI\n\nvapi.ai > sign up (no card) > Assistants > Create.\n- Model: Google Gemini\n- Voice: default or free ElevenLabs/Cartesia\n- Add 3 tools = webhook URLs from the nodes below (use PRODUCTION URL, not test)\n- Phone Numbers > Create free US number > attach assistant\n\nThen just call that number from your phone.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "n-vapi",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Vapi Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        768,
        208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GOOGLE SHEET\n\nCreate sheet: Voice Agent Tasks\nTab: Tasks\nRow 1 headers: id | task | priority | due | status\n\nIn each Google Sheets node below, pick your credential and select this sheet.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "n-sheet",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -112,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "voice-add-task",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-wh-add",
      "name": "Webhook - Add Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        64,
        576
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nconst call = body.message || body;\nconst toolCall = (call.toolCallList || call.toolCalls || [])[0] || {};\nconst args = toolCall.arguments || toolCall.function?.arguments || body;\nconst parsed = typeof args === 'string' ? JSON.parse(args) : args;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  toolCallId: toolCall.id || 'none',\n  id: Date.now().toString(),\n  task: parsed.task || 'Untitled',\n  priority: parsed.priority || 'medium',\n  due: parsed.due || 'today',\n  status: 'todo'\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "n-parse",
      "name": "Parse Add Args",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        288,
        576
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Tasks"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "id": "={{ $json.id }}",
            "task": "={{ $json.task }}",
            "priority": "={{ $json.priority }}",
            "due": "={{ $json.due }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.status }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-append",
      "name": "Sheet - Append Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        496,
        576
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { results: [ { toolCallId: $('Parse Add Args').item.json.toolCallId, result: 'Added task: ' + $('Parse Add Args').item.json.task } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-r-add",
      "name": "Respond - Added",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        576
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "voice-list-tasks",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-wh-list",
      "name": "Webhook - List Tasks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        64,
        816
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Tasks"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "status",
              "lookupValue": "todo"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-get",
      "name": "Sheet - Get Open Tasks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        288,
        816
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const tc = $('Webhook - List Tasks').first().json.body?.message?.toolCallList?.[0]?.id || 'none';\nconst rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.task);\nconst text = rows.length ? rows.map(r => `${r.task} (${r.priority}, due ${r.due})`).join('; ') : 'No open tasks.';\nreturn [{ json: { toolCallId: tc, text } }];"
      },
      "id": "n-format",
      "name": "Format Task List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        496,
        816
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { results: [ { toolCallId: $json.toolCallId, result: $json.text } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-r-list",
      "name": "Respond - Tasks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        816
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "voice-plan-day",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-wh-plan",
      "name": "Webhook - Plan Day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        64,
        1056
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Tasks"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "status",
              "lookupValue": "todo"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-get-plan",
      "name": "Sheet - Open Tasks for Planning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        288,
        1056
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const wh = $('Webhook - Plan Day').first().json.body || {};\nconst call = wh.message?.toolCallList?.[0] || {};\nlet args = call.arguments || {};\nif (typeof args === 'string') args = JSON.parse(args);\nconst rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.task);\nconst list = rows.map(r => `- ${r.task} | priority ${r.priority} | due ${r.due}`).join('\\n') || 'No tasks';\nconst prompt = `You are a personal day planner. Wake time: ${args.wake_time || '7am'}. Available hours: ${args.available_hours || 8}.\\nOpen tasks:\\n${list}\\n\\nCreate a realistic time-blocked schedule with breaks. Put high priority first. Reply in 4 to 6 short spoken sentences, no lists, no markdown.`;\nreturn [{ json: { toolCallId: call.id || 'none', prompt } }];"
      },
      "id": "n-prompt",
      "name": "Build Planning Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        496,
        1056
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ contents: [ { parts: [ { text: $json.prompt } ] } ] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-gem",
      "name": "Gemini - Plan Day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        1056
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { results: [ { toolCallId: $('Build Planning Prompt').item.json.toolCallId, result: $json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-r-plan",
      "name": "Respond - Plan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        944,
        1056
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UPGRADE PATH: TRUE GEMINI LIVE AUDIO\n\nVapi uses text LLM + TTS. For native audio-to-audio with Gemini Live, bridge phone audio over WebSocket:\n\nTwilio number > Media Streams > small Node/Python server (Pipecat or LiveKit Agents) > Gemini Live API.\n\nKeep THIS n8n workflow as the tool backend: have the Live session call these same webhooks as function calls.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "n-upgrade",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Upgrade Path",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1184,
        576
      ]
    }
  ],
